          </h2>

          <p>
            Metagenics costs between about $3.12 and $8.62 per 25 g of protein at the retail prices we found on 21 November 2026. The cheapest is Perfect Protein Pea and Rice at $74.95 for 30 servings of 20 g, or $3.12 per 25 g. Perfect Protein Whey is $79.95 for 30 servings of 20 g at Vitacost, or $3.33 per 25 g. Both are two to three times the cost of many mainstream wheys.
          </p>

